{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKgX2xYbNk2HSgYJIy9m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a build of the remaining screens, and I work through the plan. I start with the card components. I make a \"Photo\" master of 10x10 with a gray fill and a small bag glyph centered, and this same master serves as the fallback for any product without an image. I build a grid card at 164x300: a photo instance at 0,0 sized 164x168 with corner radius 10, the name at y=178 in 14 SemiBold, the desc at y=214 in 10.5 over two lines, the price at y=248 in 15 Bold, a was/off pair below it, and a rating row at y=276 with a 12px star and count. I build a deal card at 164x250 with the photo at 164x120, and a list row at 343x104 with a 96x104 photo, name at x=108, desc at y=28, price at y=62, rating at y=84. Each instance takes text overrides on Name, Desc, Price, Was, Off and Rating, and the nested Photo instance takes the fills copied from the matching image node, so 3:140 for Black Winter Jacket at ₹499 with 6,890, 3:143 for Mens Starry at ₹399 with 1,52,344, 3:146 for Black Dress at ₹2,000 with 5,23,456, 3:149 for Pink Embroidered Dress at ₹1,900 with 45,678, 3:152 for Flare Dress at ₹1,990 with 3,35,566, 3:155 for Denim Dress at ₹999 with 27,344, 3:158 for Jordan Stay at ₹4,999 with 10,23,456, 3:161 for Realme 7 at ₹3,499 with 3,44,567, 3:164 for Sony PS4 at ₹1,999 with 8,35,566, 3:167 for Black Jacket at ₹2,999 with 2,23,569, 3:170 for Men's Formal Shoes at ₹999 with 13,45,678, 3:173 for MuscleBlaze Muesli at ₹3,900 with 1,35,566, and 3:176 for Hot Chocolate at ₹200 with 6,23,569. The D7200 Digital Camera at ₹26,999 with 67,456 keeps the gray fallback. The deal and trending cards carry their was and off values, so Kurta is ₹1,500 was ₹2,499 at 40% Off, HRX is ₹2,499 was ₹4,999 at 50% Off, Philips BHH880/10 is ₹999 was ₹1,999 at 50% Off, TITAN is ₹1,500 was ₹3,500 at 57% Off, IWC is ₹650 was ₹1,599 at 59% off, Labbin is ₹650 was ₹1,250 at 48% off, Mammon handbag is ₹750 was ₹1,999 at 62% off, Wedges is ₹750 was ₹1,499 at 50% off, and Lakme is ₹950 was ₹1,990 at 52% off. The four similar products all read Nike Sneakers at ₹1,900 with ratings 46,890, 2,56,890, 1,56,890 and 96,890, the fourth priced ₹1,500, and they use images 3:197, 3:200, 3:203 and 3:206. Screen 09_Home sits at y=3680 and runs 2140 tall: status bar 44, header to 100, search 108 to 156, the sale banner at 168 to 328 as a 343x160 card with \"40–50% OFF\", \"Now in all products\", \"All colours\" and a Shop Now pill, three dots with the second current at y=336, six 50px category circles from y=356 with 9px labels, the Deal of the Day header with \"22h 55m 20s remaining\" and View all at y=444, the four deal cards in a 2x2 grid from y=480, All Featured with Sort and Filter at y=1010, Special Offers and Flat and Heels tiles at y=1048, a Hot Summer Sale banner, New Arrivals and Sponsored tiles, then Trending Products with \"Last Date 28/02/22\" and a horizontal row of 132x232 cards. I place 10_Product_List at x=460, y=2400 with a 2-column grid of 14 cards.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2396,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":114382,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2396}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55c7d231-d4f6-406f-a88f-ed2764d489e7","uuid":"3c76ab28-231a-451a-a3fc-9865a074e449","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:15:51.945Z","thinking_duration_ms":67324}
