{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhQufkI5x38bIYZdhrt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The card reactions fail because set_reactions was called without `type`/`destinationId` and the ON_CLICK NODE actions omit the \"transition\" key. The earlier successful links all include transition, so the instant variant breaks; `^Buy Now` also matched the \"Buy Now bg\" ellipse. I retry all four failures with transition included, then link Buy Now and the Home tab, and take screenshots of 17:898, 17:956 and 14:43.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4623,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":195144,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4623}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55c7d231-d4f6-406f-a88f-ed2764d489e7","uuid":"22fa5cf8-ffe2-4f8f-b770-d2085dd7b88d","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:26:13.888Z","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":7724}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhQufkI5x38bIYZdhrt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Private list before I call anything:\n\n1. **Card and Buy Now links still rejected** — all four failures say `actions[0]` failed validation, and the only difference from the links that succeeded is that I dropped the `transition` field. Retry with a transition always present.\n2. **Nav Home tab link** — the label lives inside a nested instance, so it needs either the transition fix or a transparent hotspot rectangle over the tab.\n3. **Screenshot verification of 13 and 14** — Payment's Continue moved to y=616 and the 14 backdrop must match; needs a visual check.\n4. **Screenshot verification of 02 and 05** — buttons were rebuilt there; needs a visual check.\n5. **Final report** — file URL, page ID, all 15 screen IDs, prototype coverage, limitations.\n\nItems 1, 2 are one write; 3 and 4 are screenshots of nodes that write does not touch. So all of them go out together, and 5 waits for their results."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4623,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":195144,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4623}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55c7d231-d4f6-406f-a88f-ed2764d489e7","uuid":"1c401f7d-9931-4183-8ecf-fb42f2e24871","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:26:19.377Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhQufkI5x38bIYZdhrt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01W473xzH0Cmv5B1v4rGiEYR","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.id === '5:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst log=[];\nfunction n(id){return figma.getNodeById(id);}\nfunction link(id,target){\n  try{\n    const node=n(id); if(!node){log.push('missing '+id);return;}\n    node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:target,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:{type:'DISSOLVE',easing:{type:'EASE_OUT'},duration:0.25},preserveScrollPosition:false}]}];\n    log.push('ok '+id+' -> '+target);\n  }catch(e){log.push('FAIL '+id+' '+e.message.slice(0,120));}\n}\n// grid cards on list -> detail\nconst list=n('17:417');\nlist.children.filter(c=>/^Product Card/.test(c.name)).slice(0,4).forEach(c=>link(c.id,'17:673'));\n// product cards on home -> detail\nconst home=n('17:188');\nhome.children.filter(c=>/^Product Card/.test(c.name)).slice(0,4).forEach(c=>link(c.id,'17:673'));\n// detail similar cards -> detail\nconst det=n('17:673');\ndet.children.filter(c=>/^Product Card/.test(c.name)).slice(0,2).forEach(c=>link(c.id,'17:673'));\n// Buy Now on detail -> bag\nconst buy=det.children.find(c=>c.name==='Buy Now' && c.type==='TEXT');\nif(buy) link(buy.id,'17:848'); else log.push('no Buy Now text');\n// Home tab hotspot\nconst navInst=home.children.find(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE' && /Bottom Nav/.test(c.name));\nconst inner=navInst && navInst.findOne(c=>c.name==='Label' && c.characters==='Home');\nif(inner) link(inner.id,'17:188');\nconst r=figma.createRectangle(); home.appendChild(r); r.name='Hotspot · Home tab'; r.resize(75,78); r.x=0; r.y=home.height-82; r.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:{r:0,g:0,b:0},opacity:0.001}];\nlink(r.id,'17:188');\n// Bag: wishlist entry no target; detail cart entry -> bag\nconst cartEntry=det.children.find(c=>c.name==='Cart entry');\nif(cartEntry) link(cartEntry.id,'17:848');\n// Product detail gallery dots: photo 2..5 as no-op? skip.\nreturn JSON.stringify({log:log});","description":"Retry card and Buy Now prototype links with transition","fileKey":"t59Fpla3t3vTCJcBn4Rv7i"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4623,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":195144,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4623}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55c7d231-d4f6-406f-a88f-ed2764d489e7","uuid":"e3acea7a-09ae-4e56-841d-de592d4e8371","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:26:23.284Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01W473xzH0Cmv5B1v4rGiEYR","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
