{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhU5srU4fqwMgE6Kaqd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a full set of fixes and checks on the prototype, plus independent items in one response. I privately list what comes next. First, the failed links that navigate a frame to itself are invalid and I accept them as unsupported. All 15 screens are inspected. Second, the detail frame is 2830 tall with content ending around 2350, so I shrink it to 2050 and move the nav to height-82 and the home indicator to height-34. Third, the bag frame is 1520 tall with the footer at 1520-120=1400, so I shrink it to 812. Fourth, I add tab hotspots over the cart and setting tabs on the list, detail, payment and bag screens. The write call handles all of this, and a metadata read of the page frames and page id is independent.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4838,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":199767,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4838}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55c7d231-d4f6-406f-a88f-ed2764d489e7","uuid":"4b5e2af2-55ea-4f06-916f-8914815fe31a","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:27:03.192Z","thinking_duration_ms":18411}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhU5srU4fqwMgE6Kaqd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Private list of what's still needed:\n\n1. **Prototype gaps left by self-target links** — the Home tab and similar-product cards fail because they navigate to their own frame, which Figma rejects. Those have to stay as static state; instead I'll add the real missing links: Cart tab on 09/10/11/13 to 12, Setting tab to 15.\n2. **Detail frame is 2830 tall with content ending near 1914**, leaving a large empty band before the tab bar. It should shrink to about 2050.\n3. **Bag frame is 1520 tall with an empty band above the footer.** It should shrink to 812.\n4. **First onboarding step dot is offset** (sits at 143 while step 2/3 sit at 171/199), visible in the 02 render as a slightly left-shifted active pill. Worth straightening.\n5. **Final report** needs the page ID, all screen IDs and an accurate prototype coverage statement.\n\nItems 1–4 are a single write on the same page; item 5's ID lookup does not depend on it. So I'll send those together."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4838,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":199767,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4838}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55c7d231-d4f6-406f-a88f-ed2764d489e7","uuid":"501a2dff-c4b1-4892-b5ad-0cfffa94f021","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:27:09.327Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhU5srU4fqwMgE6Kaqd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01I21ZE4QCQjlBfcQ6GZFjkG","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.id === '5:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst log=[];\nfunction n(id){return figma.getNodeById(id);}\nfunction link(id,target){try{const node=n(id);if(!node){log.push('missing '+id);return;}node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:target,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:{type:'DISSOLVE',easing:{type:'EASE_OUT'},duration:0.25},preserveScrollPosition:false}]}];log.push('ok '+id);}catch(e){log.push('FAIL '+id+' '+e.message.slice(0,90));}}\n\n// shrink 11 and 12\nconst det=n('17:673');\ndet.resize(375,2060);\nconst navD=det.children.find(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE'&&/Bottom Nav/.test(c.name));\nif(navD) navD.y=2060-82;\nconst hiD=det.children.find(c=>c.name==='Home Indicator'||(c.type==='INSTANCE'&&/Home Indicator/.test(c.name)));\ndet.children.filter(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE'&&/Home Indicator/.test(c.name)).forEach(c=>c.y=2060-34);\n\nconst bag=n('17:848');\nbag.resize(375,812);\nconst foot=bag.children.find(c=>c.name==='Footer'); if(foot) foot.y=692;\nconst footline=bag.children.find(c=>c.name==='Footer top line'); if(footline) footline.y=692;\nconst tl=bag.children.find(c=>c.name==='Total label'); if(tl) tl.y=706;\nconst tv=bag.children.find(c=>c.name==='Total value'); if(tv) tv.y=724;\nconst pb=bag.children.find(c=>c.name==='Button · Proceed to Payment'); if(pb){pb.y=716;}\nbag.children.filter(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE'&&/Home Indicator/.test(c.name)).forEach(c=>c.y=812-34);\n\n// tab hotspots on 09,10,11,13\nfunction addTabHotspots(f, cartTarget, settingTarget){\n  const nav=f.children.find(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE'&&/Bottom Nav/.test(c.name));\n  const ny=nav?nav.y:0;\n  function hs(x,name,target){const r=figma.createRectangle();f.appendChild(r);r.name='Hotspot · '+name;r.resize(75,78);r.x=x;r.y=ny;r.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:{r:0,g:0,b:0},opacity:0.001}];link(r.id,target);}\n  if(cartTarget && cartTarget!==f.id) hs(150,'Cart tab',cartTarget);\n  if(settingTarget && settingTarget!==f.id) hs(300,'Setting tab',settingTarget);\n}\naddTabHotspots(n('17:188'),'17:848','17:1026');\naddTabHotspots(n('17:417'),'17:848','17:1026');\naddTabHotspots(det,'17:848','17:1026');\naddTabHotspots(n('17:898'),'12_Shopping_Bag'==='x'?'':'17:848','17:1026');\naddTabHotspots(bag,null,'17:1026');\n\n// straighten onboarding step dots\n['14:43','14:68','14:95'].forEach(fid=>{\n  const f=n(fid);\n  const steps=f.children.filter(c=>/^Step \\d$/.test(c.name)).sort((a,b)=>a.name<b.name?-1:1);\n  if(steps.length===3){\n    // compute widths, centered row with 8 gap\n    const ws=steps.map(s=>s.width);\n    const total=ws.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)+16;\n    let x=(375-total)/2;\n    steps.forEach((s,i)=>{s.x=x; x+=s.width+8;});\n  }\n});\n\nconst screens=page.children.filter(c=>/^\\d\\d_/.test(c.name)).map(c=>({id:c.id,name:c.name,w:Math.round(c.width),h:Math.round(c.height)}));\nconst linked=page.children.filter(c=>/^\\d\\d_/.test(c.name)).map(c=>({name:c.name, reactions:c.reactions.length}));\nreturn JSON.stringify({log:log, screens:screens, linked:linked});","description":"Resize detail and bag frames, add tab hotspots, align step dots","fileKey":"t59Fpla3t3vTCJcBn4Rv7i"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4838,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":199767,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4838}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55c7d231-d4f6-406f-a88f-ed2764d489e7","uuid":"e5255028-777d-4feb-9976-bdf42192cc2f","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:27:17.075Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01I21ZE4QCQjlBfcQ6GZFjkG","display_name"