{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhXuASzPmb0DlUhDSdw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Private list before I call anything:\n\n1. **Bottom navigation is incomplete** — every screen has only a single 75×78 tab instance at x=0 (the metadata shows one \"Bottom Nav · Tab\" per frame), so 09, 10, 11 and 13 render just one tab, not the five-tab bar the brief requires in order Home, Wishlist, Cart, Search, Setting.\n2. **Home overflows its frame** — the fifth Trending card ends at y=2410 but the frame is 2140 tall, so content is clipped behind the tab bar.\n3. **Profile is mostly empty** — 1520 tall for content ending near 915.\n4. **Stray hotspot on Bag** — a \"Setting tab\" hotspot sits at y=0 on a screen that must have no main navigation.\n5. **Then verification screenshots** of Home, Payment and Profile, and the final report.\n\nItems 1–4 are one write on the same page; the screenshots depend on it, so they follow."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":23426,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":204605,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":23426}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55c7d231-d4f6-406f-a88f-ed2764d489e7","uuid":"a4dc14f9-89a8-4738-84a6-fd4bca3b4dc8","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:27:52.754Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhXuASzPmb0DlUhDSdw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01s75NyucWOj8CYaIN8WO1x6","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.id === '5:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst log=[];\nfunction n(id){return figma.getNodeById(id);}\nfunction tabComp(label){const set=n('10:34');const v=set.children.find(c=>c.name.indexOf('Tab='+label)>-1);return v;}\nfunction fullNav(f, active, y){\n  // remove old single tab + hotspots\n  f.children.slice().forEach(c=>{\n    if(/^Bottom Nav/.test(c.name)) c.remove();\n    if(/^Hotspot/.test(c.name)) c.remove();\n  });\n  const order=['Home','Wishlist','Cart','Search','Setting'];\n  order.forEach((label,i)=>{\n    const v=tabComp(label); if(!v) return;\n    const inst=v.createInstance(); f.appendChild(inst);\n    inst.name='Nav · '+label; inst.x=i*75; inst.y=y;\n    // recolor for active state\n    const wanted = label===active;\n    const isActive = v.name.indexOf('Tab=Home')>-1; // base variant built as Home-active\n    if(wanted!==isActive){\n      inst.findAll(x=>{ if('fills' in x && Array.isArray(x.fills) && x.fills.length){\n        const f0=x.fills[0]; if(f0 && f0.type==='SOLID'){\n          const c=f0.color; const isBrand = Math.abs(c.r-0.9725)<0.01 && Math.abs(c.g-0.2157)<0.01;\n          const isGrey = Math.abs(c.r-0.4)<0.02 && Math.abs(c.g-0.439)<0.03;\n          if(isBrand) x.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:{r:0.4,g:0.439,b:0.522}}];\n          if(isGrey) x.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:{r:0.9725,g:0.2157,b:0.3451}}];\n        }\n      }});\n      inst.findAll(x=>{\n        if(x.name==='Active dot'){ if(wanted){x.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:{r:0.9725,g:0.2157,b:0.3451}}];} else {x.fills=[];} }\n      });\n    }\n  });\n  // hotspots\n  const map={Home:'17:188',Wishlist:null,Cart:'17:848',Search:null,Setting:'17:1026'};\n  order.forEach((label,i)=>{\n    const target=map[label];\n    if(!target || target===f.id) return;\n    const r=figma.createRectangle(); f.appendChild(r);\n    r.name='Hotspot · '+label; r.resize(75,78); r.x=i*75; r.y=y;\n    r.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:{r:0,g:0,b:0},opacity:0.001}];\n    try{r.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:target,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:{type:'DISSOLVE',easing:{type:'EASE_OUT'},duration:0.25},preserveScrollPosition:false}]}];}catch(e){log.push('link fail '+label);}\n  });\n}\n// Home: extend height then nav at bottom\nconst home=n('17:188');\nhome.resize(375,2500);\nfullNav(home,'Home',2500-82);\nhome.children.filter(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE'&&/Home Indicator/.test(c.name)).forEach(c=>c.y=2500-34);\n\nconst list=n('17:417');\nfullNav(list,'Home',2560-82);\nlist.children.filter(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE'&&/Home Indicator/.test(c.name)).forEach(c=>c.y=2560-34);\n\nconst det=n('17:673');\nfullNav(det,'Home',2060-82);\ndet.children.filter(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE'&&/Home Indicator/.test(c.name)).forEach(c=>c.y=2060-34);\n\nconst pay=n('17:898');\nfullNav(pay,'Cart',730);\nconst succ=n('17:956');\nconst base=succ.children.find(c=>c.name==='13_Payment (behind)');\nif(base) fullNav(base,'Cart',730);\n\nconst bag=n('17:848');\nbag.children.slice().forEach(c=>{ if(/^Hotspot/.test(c.name)) c.remove(); });\n\nconst prof=n('17:1026');\nprof.resize(375,960);\nprof.children.filter(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE'&&/Home Indicator/.test(c.name)).forEach(c=>c.y=960-34);\n\nreturn JSON.stringify({log:log, home:{h:home.height}, prof:{h:prof.height}});","description":"Build full five-tab navigation, resize Home and Profile, clear stray hotspot","fileKey":"t59Fpla3t3vTCJcBn4Rv7i"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":23426,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":204605,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":23426}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55c7d231-d4f6-406f-a88f-ed2764d489e7","uuid":"9278de13-16ff-423d-9295-2d8a3ae04284","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:28:00.666Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01s75NyucWOj8CYaIN8WO1x6","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
