{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhfvq9QvYuNl8Obe4AK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about the final design gaps: the bottom nav icons on Home and 11 render as gray/red square blocks. I trace this to recolor() setting fills on every node with fills, including the instance root, so a filled square sits behind each glyph. The fix is to skip the instance root, clear its fills, and recolor only vector descendants plus label text. The active Home dot shows a red block for the same reason. All other items check out fine.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3991,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":233668,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3991}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55c7d231-d4f6-406f-a88f-ed2764d489e7","uuid":"769a1e49-b7a5-416a-a2a6-710aeb10ee57","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:29:18.014Z","thinking_duration_ms":7944}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhfvq9QvYuNl8Obe4AK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Private list before this response: the tab-bar icons in 09, 10, 11 and 13 render as solid square blocks (grey, and red for the active tab), because my recolour pass painted every node that had fills — including the tab instance's own white background rect — instead of only the vector glyphs. That is a real visual defect and must be fixed before I report completion. It is a single write on nodes the last screenshots already showed, so I'll do it now with one targeted fix."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3991,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":233668,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3991}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55c7d231-d4f6-406f-a88f-ed2764d489e7","uuid":"f0221e14-2890-4496-b93d-0d04d1129bd9","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:29:21.400Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhfvq9QvYuNl8Obe4AK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01aupUA1Zt74zjWRwsslRp0Y","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.id === '5:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const s of ['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold']) { try { await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Montserrat', style:s}); } catch(e){} }\nconst log=[];\nconst ACTIVE={r:0.9725,g:0.2157,b:0.3451};\nconst IDLE={r:0.4,g:0.439,b:0.522};\nconst screens=['17:188','17:417','17:673','17:898'];\nconst base=figma.getNodeById('17:956');\nconst behind=base && base.children.find(c=>c.name==='13_Payment (behind)');\nconst frames=screens.map(figma.getNodeById);\nif(behind) frames.push(behind);\n\nframes.forEach(f=>{\n  if(!f) return;\n  const navs=f.children.filter(c=>/^Nav · /.test(c.name));\n  navs.forEach(inst=>{\n    const active=/Home$/.test(inst.name)? (f.name.indexOf('13_Payment')>-1? false : true) : (/Cart$/.test(inst.name) && f.name.indexOf('13_Payment')>-1 ? true : false);\n    // clear instance-level fill so no block shows\n    inst.fills=[];\n    // vectors only\n    inst.findAll(x=>{\n      if(x.type!=='VECTOR') return;\n      x.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color: active?ACTIVE:IDLE}];\n    });\n    // labels\n    const lbl=inst.findOne(x=>x.type==='TEXT');\n    if(lbl){ lbl.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color: active?ACTIVE:IDLE}]; }\n    // active dot\n    const dot=inst.findOne(x=>x.name==='Active dot');\n    if(dot){ dot.fills = active? [{type:'SOLID',color:ACTIVE}] : []; }\n  });\n  log.push(f.name+' navs '+navs.length);\n});\nreturn JSON.stringify({log:log});","description":"Fix tab bar icons: transparent tab background, recolour glyphs only","fileKey":"t59Fpla3t3vTCJcBn4Rv7i"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_inpu