{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhp4PRqVSlzrdG3rBnI","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Private list of what I need next:\n\n1. **Diagnose the Home tab-bar blocks** — Payment's nav now renders real glyphs, but Home's still shows filled rounded squares, so the two instances differ structurally. I need to dump the child nodes of one Home tab and one Payment tab to see which node paints the block.\n2. **Fix card text collisions** — product names and descriptions still overlap prices on Home and Product List cards; the master cards need tighter, guaranteed metrics rather than another guess.\n3. **Investigate the stray line through \"Buy Now ›\"** on Product Detail.\n4. **Then re-verify** Home, Product List and Detail, and write the final report.\n\nThe diagnosis read and the card-master write do not depend on each other, so both go now."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3569,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":245195,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3569}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55c7d231-d4f6-406f-a88f-ed2764d489e7","uuid":"7a449ba5-412a-4a8a-9225-e6ee6965e6f4","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:31:32.634Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhp4PRqVSlzrdG3rBnI","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Pg9DX5lHNuNZjgxrGyTNxv","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.id === '5:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfunction dump(id){\n  const n=figma.getNodeById(id); if(!n) return {id, missing:true};\n  function d(x, depth){\n    const o={t:x.type, n:x.name, w:Math.round(x.width), h:Math.round(x.height), x:Math.round(x.x), y:Math.round(x.y)};\n    try{ if(Array.isArray(x.fills)&&x.fills.length) o.f = x.fills.map(f=>f.type==='SOLID'? 'solid': f.type); }catch(e){}\n    try{ if(Array.isArray(x.strokes)&&x.strokes.length) o.s = x.strokes.length; }catch(e){}\n    if(depth<3 && x.children) o.c = x.children.map(c=>d(c,depth+1));\n    return o;\n  }\n  return d(n,0);\n}\nconst home=figma.getNodeById('17:188');\nconst pay=figma.getNodeById('17:898');\nconst homeTab=home.children.find(c=>c.name==='Nav · Home');\nconst payTab=pay.children.find(c=>c.name==='Nav · Home');\nconst detail=figma.getNodeById('17:673');\nconst buyTexts=detail.children.filter(c=>c.type==='TEXT'&&/Buy Now/.test(c.name)).map(c=>({id:c.id,name:c.name,y:c.y,h:c.height,text:c.characters,dec:(function(){try{return c.textDecoration}catch(e){return 'n/a'}})()}));\nconst nearby=detail.children.filter(c=>c.y>=1205 && c.y<=1245).map(c=>({id:c.id,name:c.name,type:c.type,y:c.y,h:Math.round(c.height),w:Math.round(c.width)}));\nreturn JSON.stringify({homeTab: dump(homeTab?homeTab.id:'') , payTab: dump(payTab?payTab.id:''), buyTexts, nearby});","description":"Inspect nav tab structure and Buy Now text on detail","fileKey":"t59Fpla3t3vTCJcBn4Rv7i"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3569,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":245195,"cache_creation":