{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgKhw62RqXKkD25KfRRY5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Private list of what I need next:\n\n1. **\"No photo\" label is stamped over real product photos.** In the new renders every image card still shows the placeholder's \"No photo\" text on top of the actual photography, because the Photo component keeps that label when I swap in an image fill. This is a visible defect on Product List and in the Similar To grid.\n2. **Re-verify Home, Product List and Detail** once that label is hidden on image-backed cards only, leaving it visible on the three genuine fallbacks (Philips, Mammon handbag, D7200).\n3. **Then the final report**: file URL, page ID, 15 screen IDs, prototype coverage, limitations.\n\nItem 2 depends on item 1, so only the fix can go now; the screenshots follow from its result."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":5524,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":254519,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5524}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55c7d231-d4f6-406f-a88f-ed2764d489e7","uuid":"e028ed8d-57df-4d6a-a3f6-9b70e73f9c9a","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:32:47.231Z"}
